    }
  ],
  "translation": "Gomme go ba gore go tsea go be bonolo go yena go sepela mabusing a Yarobeamo morwa wa Nebate, a tšea mosadi ⟨את⟩ Izebele, morwedi wa Etbeale, kgosi ya ba-Tsidona, gomme a sepela, a šomela ⟨את⟩ Baale, gomme a thularela go yena.",
